\f1 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 <$Scr_H::2><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f2\i\b\fs36 ## The Template\
\pard\tx0\tx0\tx567\tx1134\tx1701\sl312\slmult1\pardirnatural\qj\partightenfactor0

\f1\i0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2><!$Scr_Ps::0>
\f0 \
In the context of [context],\
we faced the challenge of [problem].\
We decided on [selected option],\
and neglected [alternative options],\
to achieve [benefits],\
accepting [drawbacks/risks].\
\
